    "detailed_description": "Beeswing is a game set in a small village in rural Scotland, the village I grew up in, home. Visit the places and people who shaped a life and discover their stories. Represented in hand painted, water colour graphics with a unique, acoustic soundtrack.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365580/extras/31b4dcdeda035b138fc45671a8d1eb5d.avif?t=1725203033\" /></div><br>New game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No puzzles or fighting or anything like that. </li><li>Under 3 hours of content! </li><li>Stuff you find in your regular day like people who leave their TV on when they have visitors and friends feeling a bit glum! </li><li>My mum, she's there. </li><li> Quite a slow movement speed. </li><li> Old People! </li><li>Sad bits.</li><li>and not much more!</li></ul>",
